reagent-name-xeno-slime-growth-factor = slime growth factor
reagent-desc-xeno-slime-growth-factor = A viscous grey compound extracted from grey xeno-slimes. Acts as a catalyst for growing new slimes.

reagent-name-slime-steroid = slime steroid
reagent-desc-slime-steroid = A potent purple fluid extracted from purple xeno-slimes. Enhances physical performance for a short time.

reagent-name-slime-stabilizer = slime stabilizer
reagent-desc-slime-stabilizer = A blue compound that keeps xeno-slimes docile. Useful for xenobiologists who value their lives.

reagent-name-cooling-potion = cooling potion
reagent-desc-cooling-potion = An icy blue potion extracted from dark-blue xeno-slimes. Provides resistance to heat damage.

reagent-name-teleport-potion = teleportation potion
reagent-desc-teleport-potion = A shimmering teal liquid extracted from bluespace xeno-slimes. Supposedly allows teleportation.

reagent-name-xeno-sepia-potion = sepia potion
reagent-desc-xeno-sepia-potion = A dark amber fluid extracted from sepia xeno-slimes. Said to distort the flow of time.

reagent-name-laser-prot-potion = laser protection potion
reagent-desc-laser-prot-potion = A clear red fluid extracted from sepia xeno-slimes. Provides resistance to laser and energy damage.

reagent-name-xeno-cerulean-potion = extractor enhancer potion
reagent-desc-xeno-cerulean-potion = A vibrant sky-blue fluid extracted from cerulean xeno-slimes. Enhances xenobiological extraction processes.

reagent-name-rad-prot-potion = radiation protection potion
reagent-desc-rad-prot-potion = A glowing green fluid extracted from pyrite xeno-slimes. Flushes radiation from the body.

reagent-name-bio-prot-potion = biohazard protection potion
reagent-desc-bio-prot-potion = A dark green fluid extracted from green xeno-slimes. Provides resistance to biological and toxic agents.

reagent-name-slime-mutation-potion = slime mutation potion
reagent-desc-slime-mutation-potion = A volatile red fluid extracted from red xeno-slimes. Causes rapid genetic mutation in slimes.

reagent-name-speed-potion = speed potion
reagent-desc-speed-potion = A fiery orange fluid extracted from red xeno-slimes. Drastically increases movement speed for a short time.

reagent-name-obedience-potion = obedience potion
reagent-desc-obedience-potion = A sweet pink fluid extracted from pink xeno-slimes. Makes slimes calm and cooperative.

reagent-name-primate-language-potion = primate language potion
reagent-desc-primate-language-potion = A cinnamon-brown fluid extracted from pink xeno-slimes. Allows understanding of primate vocalizations.

reagent-name-explosion-prot-potion = explosion protection potion
reagent-desc-explosion-prot-potion = A grey opaque fluid extracted from oil xeno-slimes. Hardens tissue against explosive force.

reagent-name-acid-prot-potion = acid protection potion
reagent-desc-acid-prot-potion = A caustic-looking lime fluid extracted from black xeno-slimes. Neutralizes acid and caustic damage.

reagent-name-advanced-mutation-toxin = advanced mutation toxin
reagent-desc-advanced-mutation-toxin = A potent dark-green mutagenic compound extracted from black xeno-slimes. Far more powerful than unstable mutagen.

reagent-name-mind-potion = mind potion
reagent-desc-mind-potion = A shimmering pink fluid extracted from light-pink xeno-slimes. Said to awaken the consciousness of slimes.

reagent-name-consciousness-transfer-potion = consciousness transfer potion
reagent-desc-consciousness-transfer-potion = A mysterious magenta fluid extracted from rainbow xeno-slimes. Supposedly allows transferring one's consciousness into another body.
